      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: Yeah, but it's not the devs seeking the thing out to patch it. The bulk of the mechanic still works, it's just something in the latest patch broke fixedjoints, which could be indicative of a larger unintended issue.\n\nPlus, aint nothing wrong with collider flight. It's fun as hell and anyone can do it. Can't be used to troll or cheat except in minigames, and cheating in a minigame is like cheating on a survey. Entirely pointless.",
