  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So I've been using a system on one of my avatars to glide/fly around a world, but when this update rolled out, it stopped working. Context on how this worked:\nI had a collider system that would let me fly around at select speeds, one for normal walking, one for moderately quick speeds, and one for much faster speeds. The one that I would walk on, which was the one that I would use by default, had been broken in this update. I have a likely suspicion about what's going on.\nThe one I walked on was using a Fixed Joint component so I could stay in place upon it instead of shooting forward as the other ones did. Now, since this is broken, my main collider shoots me forward as well. I have tried mending this issue with a number of fixes but none have worked.\nAnyway, that's enough out of me. I think I made it clear what this issue is. Thanks for reading.",
